OL,3,APolice crack down on 'cockroach'
OL,4,Aprotest in Delhi as group says leaders
OL,5,Adetained
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of security personnel
OL,8,Fhave been deployed and roads barricaded
OL,9,Fin Delhi to stop the latest Cockroach
OL,10,FJanta Party demonstration
OL,12,FThe group says its leader, Abhijeet
OL,13,FDipke, is among hundreds reportedly
OL,14,Fdetained since Friday evening - who is
OL,15,Fhe?
OL,17,FDipke - who has said he is prepared to
OL,18,Fgo to jail - started the movement in
OL,19,FMay almost as a joke in response to a
OL,20,Fremark by India's Chief Justice Surya
OL,21,FKant, who had likened jobless
OL,22,Fyoungsters to "cockroaches"
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
